	<object class="Event" id="{f26b9b93-63a5-48d8-8850-b1264cfd0c77}">
		<property name="note">
			<value>Parameters in use:
Idle - should simply be called from 0s to 1s despite being a continuous variable. Set up in a way where directly setting it to 1 will cause the 'Active' layer to fade out and leave only the base. Can be reused for different tracks in the game.

StartAtClimax - a discrete variable used to make the music start directly from section B (the climax) when called. designed for use in that one part of the prologue after they leave the town hall. Can be reused for different tracks in the game.

InPrologue - discrete variable that locks the music into its 'idle' state (no active layer) and causes the music to only loop section A without going to section B. Should be set to 1 for the prologue up until the town hall.</value>
		</property>
